{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Challenges"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Gala"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe the reasons or results of events or actions in spoken or written texts, in work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Integrates factual information to a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge in the workplace."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn11le09ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Result Clauses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use linking words when you want to introduce clauses that express results. Linking words help you connect the ideas in a sentence. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "A common linking phrase that you use in result clauses is <span class=\"italic\">so</span>.<br/><span class=\"italic\">So</span> introduces the result of something. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I am very nervous. <span class=\"strong\">So</span>, I may need something a little stronger.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">as a result</span> to introduce a result."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">As a result</span> of everything going well, is it time to mingle?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">therefore</span> and <span class=\"italic\">consequently</span> at the beginning of sentences to introduce a result."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">First, we do a sweep to make sure everything is setup properly. <span class=\"strong\">Therefore</span>, there are no surprises. </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Second, make sure we have enough food and drink for everyone. <span class=\"strong\">Consequently</span>, everyone will be happy. </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">As a result</span> of everything going well, is it time to mingle?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "First, we do a sweep to make sure everything is setup properly. <span class=\"strong\">Therefore</span>, there are no surprises. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Second, make sure we have enough food and drink for everyone. <span class=\"strong\">Consequently</span>, everyone will be happy. "}, {"type": "example", "content": " I am very nervous. <span class=\"strong\">So</span>, I may need something a little stronger."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Reason Clauses "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you want to refer to the reason for something, you can use reason clauses introduced by a linking word. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some common linking words you use in reason clauses are:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">because</span>, <span class=\"italic\">since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">as</span>, and <span class=\"italic\">so</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">Because </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use <span class=\"italic\">because</span> to introduce a reason, you use it with a subject and a verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm so excited <span class=\"strong\">because this is all so new to me</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">Since/As </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Since</span> and <span class=\"italic\">as</span> are more informal, and they are followed by a subject  and a verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">As you are the star of the show</span>, we'll need you to say a few words.<br/>Help her with anything she needs <span class=\"strong\">since she is the guest of honor</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">just in case</span> as a linking phrase. It means \u201cin the case that\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Copy 100 <span class=\"strong\">just in case we have unexpected guests</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm so excited because this is all so new to me."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Help her with anything she needs since she is the guest of honor."}, {"type": "example", "content": "As you are the star of the show, we'll need you to say a few words."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Copy 100 just in case we have unexpected guests."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gang"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a group of friends, co-workers "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ok. Gang, let's split up."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob10aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when organizing an event."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "running smoothly"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "happening without problems"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Everything looks like it is running smoothly"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob10aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sweep"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bmovement, \u200bespecially a \u200bquick one to check for things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: First, we do a sweep to make sure everything is setup properly. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob10aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to shepherd"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to lead people somewhere"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: After that, shepherd Marisa."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob10aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brochure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small book or magazine containing pictures and information about a product or service"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  Adam we need more brochures so that we can pass them out to the guests"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob10aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to choke up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to have difficulty continuing with speech or actions due to overwhelming emotions"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm so excited because this is all so new to me. (choking up) I wish my father was here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn11le09ob10aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Imagine that you are on the committee responsible for planning the holiday office party at work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Brainstorm a list of things you need to consider for the party."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Include details about the following aspects: the date and time, invitations and guest list, location, food/ drinks, budget and music/ entertainment."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Discuss your ideas in groups and explain your decisions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make a final decision on the details for the holiday office party."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I brainstorm ideas for a holiday office party where I work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of things necessary for the party."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss different aspects of the party in a group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I come to a decision with my group about the details for the party."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn11le09ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn11le09ob10re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: As a result of everything going well, is it time to mingle?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Not yet. Ok. gang. Everything looks like it is running smoothly. So this is how it is going to play out. First, we do a sweep to make sure everything is setup properly. Therefore, there are no surprises. Second, make sure we have enough food and drink for everyone. Consequently, everyone is happy. After that, shepherd Marisa. Make her feel comfortable. I'll get up and say a few words so that everyone is up to speed and then we'll bring Marisa up to say a few words. Finally, we mingle and keep guests happy. Any questions? Ok. Go to work.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:   Adam we need more brochures so that we can pass them out to the guests.", "id": 1}, {"time": "49000", "image": "engenn11le09ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>:  I'll take care of it. Would you like me to copy out 20 or 50?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Copy 50 just in case we have unexpected guests.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: Kristi, Marisa is here. Can you get a glass of wine for her and help her with anything she needs since she is the guest of honour, she will need to be taken care of. Where is Adam?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: He is copying brochures. Hi Marisa, you look wonderful.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: Thank you!", "id": 2}, {"time": "74000", "image": "engenn11le09ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: So, in a little while, Denise is getting up and saying a few words in about five minutes and as you are the star of the show, we'll need you to say a few words when you are ready.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: I'm so excited because this is all so new to me. I wish my father were here. He'd always help me with my writing.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Would you like a glass of wine?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Marisa</span>: Do you have anything stronger? I am very nervous. Consequently, I may need something a little stronger.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I'll get it for you.", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le09ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le09ob10re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss reasons and results of an event or action related to work and jobs."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express willingness or intention to do something in work and job issues."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can exchange complex professional information related to work and job issues."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Have you tried to organize an event before?What kind?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Are you good at small talk? Do you like to mingle at parties? Why or why not?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "A Gala Event at the office."}], "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "id": 0}, {"type": "STI", "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": 